// OpenCode config snippet — Unterm MCP server.
//
// PREREQUISITE: install the Unterm desktop app first. Download:
//
//     https://unterm.app/api/download
//
// Open Unterm once so its MCP server boots.
//
// File: merge the `mcp` block below into your `opencode.json` (per-project,
// or the global one under ~/.config/opencode/opencode.json — OpenCode looks
// at both). Note OpenCode's MCP block is `mcp` (not `mcpServers`), the
// command is an ARRAY, and the type is `local` (stdio).
//
// Auto-wire shortcut: launching OpenCode from Unterm
// (`unterm-cli agent launch opencode`) writes this entry for you.

{
  "mcp": {
    "unterm": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": ["unterm-cli", "mcp-stdio"]
    }
  }
}
